88581","url":"https://www.twitch.tv/directory/game/2Person"}]},{"igdb_id":385996,"name":"2-Player Games for 1 Device","summary":"Four classic board games in one app! Two players can take turns playing these games on one device: Chess, Checkers (or Draughts), Othello (or Reversi), Four In A Row (try to connect four pieces in a row). Nothing fancy. No online games, no AI for solo games. No ads, no connection required, no special permissions required. Just four classic games in one small package.","genres":["Indie","Card & Board Game"],"developers":["Pandcorps"],"publishers":["Pandcorps"],"aggregated_rating":null,"release_date":1604102400,"platforms":["Android"],"cover_url":"//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/cobawy.jpg","external_ids":[{"category":14,"store":"playstation","uid":"98233350","url":"https://www.twitch.tv/directory/game/2-Player%20Games%20for%201%20Device"}]}]